[25.357308, "o", "Requirements:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. Create directory /srv/shared with the following properties:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Owned by group \"research\" \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Set the setgid bit so new files inherit the group\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Base permissions: 2770 (rwxrws---)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 2. Configure ACLs on /srv/shared:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Group \"research\": full rwx permissions (both current and default)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Users \"alice\" and \"bob\": full rwx permissions (both current and default)  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Others: no permissions (both current and default)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Set proper mask to allow full permissions\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. The ACL configuration must ensure that:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Any file created by alice or bob in /srv/shared is accessible by both users\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - The permissions are inherited by subdirectories and files\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>    - Users outside the research group cannot access the directory or its contents\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Note: Do NOT create any files in the directory. The tests will verify permission inheritance\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> by creating files during the testing phase.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> END'; tmux wait -S done\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
