[36.884595, "o", "ls -la /srv/shared — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash # Final comprehensive verification echo \"=== Full ACL dump ===\" getfac…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 6 tool call(s) so far\r\nEverything is configured correctly. Here's a summary of what was set up:\r\n\r\n**Directory: `/srv/shared`**\r\n- **Owner:** `root:research`\r\n- **Base permissions:** `2770` (rwxrws---) with setgid bit set\r\n- The `+` in the listing confirms ACLs are active\r\n\r\n**Current ACLs:**\r\n| Entry | Permissions |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| `user::rwx` | Owner (root) full access |\r\n| `user:alice:rwx` | Alice full access |\r\n| `user:bob:rwx` | Bob full access |\r\n| `group::rwx` | Owning group full access |\r\n| `group:research:rwx` | Research group full access |\r\n| `mask::rwx` | Mask allows all named entries |\r\n| `other::---` | No access for others |\r\n\r\n**Default ACLs (inherited by new files/subdirectories):**\r\n| Entry | Permissions |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| `default:user::rwx` | Owner inherits rwx |\r\n| `default:user:alice:rwx` | Alice inherits rwx |\r\n| `default:user:bob:rwx` | Bob inherits rwx |\r\n| `default:group::rwx` | Owning group inherits rwx |\r\n| `default:group:research:rwx` | Research group inherits rwx |\r\n| `default:mask::rwx` | Mask allows full inherited permissions |\r\n| `default:other::---` | Others get no inherited permissions |\r\n\r\n**How it works:**\r\n- The **setgid bit** ensures new files/directories inherit the `research` group\r\n- **Default ACLs** ensure any file or subdirectory created inside inherits the same ACL entries (alice:rwx, bob:rwx, research:rwx, other:---)\r\n- The **mask** is set to `rwx` so it doesn't restrict the effective permissions of any named user or group entry\r\n- **Others** have no permissions at any level, blocking unauthorized access\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=6 surface=d1e34a72922b\r\n"]
